'''Secret Woods (SVE)''' is a [[Locations|location]] that replaces the map of the vanilla [[Stardew:Secret Woods|Secret Woods]].

Major changes include new foragables, a larger layout, a maze, and new fish. But aspects like the hardwood stumps and slimes that will attack the player still exist. 
{{TOC}}
==Old Master Cannoli== 
[[File:Secret Woods Maze Solution.png|thumb|Path to reach the statue]]
[[Stardew:Old Master Cannoli|Old Master Cannoli's]] statue now requires going through a maze to reach the statue and claim the stardrop. 
